Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是海豚？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請問您懂了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想會議差不多要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好像得決定古諾希亞是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,您好  我叫乙女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被賦予智慧的海豚？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我果然很奇怪吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因為其實我並沒有很了解人類
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怕自己會講什麼奇怪的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是不會啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真厲害  原來在不同的世界線\N還會出現這樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不對  這算是人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他們就是這次的成員
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:06.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:12.56,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! 蛻變化身吧 Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:15.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.17,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ざばぁん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.99,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}潜伏しながら行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:23.61,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Guess Doubt 壊れる思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:26.24,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の殻破り 突き出る角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.12,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}正気はいらないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:29.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I'll take you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}破れハウトゥー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.87,0:01:33.71,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}笑えるわ 裏切りだらけの生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:34.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Bet on me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:37.13,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吊し上げて堕とす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:40.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}それでは皆 Nice tripを
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:45.35,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手を伸ばしたその先に幸よあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:46.55,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}廻り廻って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:47.94,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}変わり変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:50.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の形捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:51.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:55.48,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}救いよあれ 騙し騙されのゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:59.01,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一心不乱にあがいて 切り裂く逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:01.44,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}足元にTake care
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.46,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:06.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}憂いのない 電脳化されたHeaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:08.47,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一瞬の油断が最後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:12.31,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}剥ぎ取るよ化けの皮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:15.28,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:17.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:20.71,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
